<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>每日冷知识 - 沙雕园</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%86%B7%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/</link><description>欢迎来到沙雕园。本博客要素较多，包括但不限于数学、编程、游戏、吐槽、冲塔、科普、整活。</description><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%86%B7%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>#每日单词 #每日冷知识 Chronostasis 来，中文一般…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-115861282033347894/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-115861282033347894/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%8D%95%E8%AF%8D" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日单词&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%86%B7%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日冷知识&lt;/span>&lt;/a> Chronostasis 来，中文一般叫 时间停滞错觉，也有人叫 停表错觉。最经典的体验就是你猛地看向挂钟的时候，会觉得秒针第一下好像卡住了，比正常的一秒要长一点点。实际上钟没坏，是你脑子在偷偷“补帧”。 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/68996c9cf4c6db7d8438.png" alt=":doge_a1:" title=":doge_a1:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p>&lt;p>原理其实挺有意思的。你眼睛在快速转动时，会发生一种叫“眼跳”的动作。这一瞬间，大脑为了不让世界看起来一闪一闪的，会直接把这段模糊的信息给屏蔽掉。问题来了，屏蔽完之后，大脑又不甘心空着，于是就把你刚看到的画面往前“回填”了一点点时间。结果你主观上就觉得，诶，时间好像停住了。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#每日冷知识 “明天”是不是应该叫noterday，因为是yes…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114150094629511620/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114150094629511620/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%86%B7%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日冷知识&lt;/span>&lt;/a> “明天”是不是应该叫noterday，因为是yesterday的反义词 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/2ed4d525f5ad0fdaa44f.png" alt=":annoyingdog:" title=":annoyingdog:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#每日冷知识 太阳对月球儿的引力是地球儿对月球儿引力的2倍</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114130025771157235/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-114130025771157235/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%86%B7%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日冷知识&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 太阳对月球儿的引力是地球儿对月球儿引力的2倍 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/68996c9cf4c6db7d8438.png" alt=":doge_a1:" title=":doge_a1:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#每日冷知识 #每日火星 原来狗和狼是同一物种儿的不同亚种儿 所…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112143817656045999/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112143817656045999/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%86%B7%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日冷知识&lt;/span>&lt;/a> &lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E7%81%AB%E6%98%9F" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日火星&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 原来狗和狼是同一物种儿的不同亚种儿 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/630adb3280013865f421.png" alt=":tv50:" title=":tv50:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 所以说狗就是狼 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/630adb3280013865f421.png" alt=":tv50:" title=":tv50:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 甚至狗和狼之间没有生殖隔离&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112143817656045999/image-182b096da17f29fe.jpeg">&lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112143817656045999/image-182b096da17f29fe.jpeg" alt="配图 1" loading="lazy">&lt;/a>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>#每日冷知识 今天才知道doge 读音是dəʊdʒ，不是dog</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-106246295913691046/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-106246295913691046/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E5%86%B7%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日冷知识&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 今天才知道doge &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/3e61fa70b0bd2f2541c0.png" alt=":doge:" title=":doge:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 读音是dəʊdʒ，不是dog &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/3e61fa70b0bd2f2541c0.png" alt=":doge:" title=":doge:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p>
